### 1. Obtener todos los objetos RPG
GET http://localhost:5000/api/items
Accept: application/json

### 2. Crear una nueva espada legendaria
POST http://localhost:5000/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Espada de Escarcha +5",
  "category": "Arma",
  "rarity": "Legendario",
  "basePrice": 2500.00,
  "imageUrl": "/images/items/frostmourne.png"
}
